[[Image:Is illusion.gif|right|Illusion]]

Spells from the '''illusion''' [[spell school]] are used to alter perception and generate illusions.

This school is traditionally a favorite of [[gnome]]s, so [[player character]]s of that race automatically receive [[spell focus]] in illusion, regardless of whether or not they can cast spells. (This tradition dates back to the first edition of (Advanced) [[Dungeons & Dragons]], when gnomes could be illusionists but not more general magic-users.)

'''Prohibited school:''' [[enchantment]]<br />
'''Prohibited to:''' diviners and enchanters

== Spells ==

The illusion spells are the following, organized by [[innate level]].
Since [[wizard]]s have a greater interest in spell schools than other classes (because they can specialize in a school), the spell that is not a wizard spell is ''in italics''.

